abstract: "A complete AI Operating System that runs locally on your machine. Includes Research Assistant, Writing Studio, Visual Builder, Document Generator, Brand Workspace, Task Scheduler, Calendar, and Telegram integration. Features the Model Message Bus and Vector Lake architecture for intelligent LLM communication and persistent memory."

